  "scenario": "Ana is at a train station. She cannot hear the announcement because there is a lot of noise. She asks a man to repeat the information. Later, she talks to a friend about the problem and they decide to listen to the news together.",
  "introduction_md": "¿Alguna vez no escuchaste bien a alguien o no entendiste una palabra? ¡Es normal! En esta lección vas a aprender a manejar problemas de comunicación en inglés.\n\nVas a practicar cómo:\n\n- Decir que no escuchaste o que hay mucho ruido.\n- Pedir que repitan algo.\n- Explicar que no entiendes una palabra.\n- Usar 'will' para decisiones rápidas, como ofrecer ayuda.\n\nEstas frases te van a ayudar en viajes, en el trabajo y en la vida diaria. Al final, podrás resolver malentendidos con confianza y seguir conversando sin miedo. ¡Vamos a practicar!",
  "intro_target": "Have you ever not heard someone well or not understood a word? It is normal! In this lesson, you will learn to handle communication problems in English.\n\nYou will practice how to:\n\n- Say that you did not hear or that there is a lot of noise.\n- Ask someone to repeat something.\n- Explain that you do not understand a word.\n- Use 'will' for quick decisions, like offering help.\n\nThese phrases will help you when you travel, at work, and in daily life. At the end, you will be able to solve misunderstandings with confidence and keep talking without fear. Let us practice!",
